Package: nestimand
Title: Estimands for Partially Nested Designs by Cell Translation
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Andrew J.", "Milne",
                  email = "A.Milne@westernsydney.edu.au",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Declares a partially nested design once, fits it in the realized-cell
    parameterization, where estimation is unconditionally well posed, and
    translates grids, labels, draws, priors, and results back into the original
    variable space in which research questions, priors, and reports are stated.
    Estimand scripts are emitted as readable code rather than executed behind a
    wrapper.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: marginaleffects, emmeans, lme4, ordinal, brms, posterior
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
